--- !u!114 &135065975
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 135065973}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d5e33c67f312fe45b88b04a3aece7bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LanternKeeper.StoryNote
  noteId: Note1_Lanterns
  title: Tacked to the fence post
  body: 'Mabel,


    Every porch gets its jack-o''-lantern lit before dark tonight, same as every Halloween. Grandpa says the old farmhands still walk the rows after harvest, and a warm light on a porch is what keeps them easy.


    If you take the lantern out past the patch, mind the candle. It burns quicker than you think, and the stubs I left along the way are all there is.


    - Pa'
  readRange: 1.9
