  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1301677675}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d5e33c67f312fe45b88b04a3aece7bb, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LanternKeeper.StoryNote
  noteId: Note4_Candy
  title: Ma's note by the candy bowl
  body: 'Help yourself, and take a few for the walk.


    The farmhands always had a sweet tooth. Bertie would down tools for a butterscotch, and nothing has changed. Toss one where you want them to go and they''ll float right over and forget all about you.


    Pa swears the cemetery gate only opens when one of them is standing on the old stone. Handy thing, a hungry ghost.'
  readRange: 1.9
